  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 Bundles apexmaps 1.3.0. Adds the hexbin series (HexbinSeries, HexbinDatum), which bins\n      points into a hexagonal lattice sized in screen pixels and colours each cell by count, sum,\n      mean, min or max. Adds GeoOptions.Layout, which draws a region set as a hex tile map instead\n      of its real boundaries and morphs between the two when it is toggled. Both are licensed\n      features: they work without a key for evaluation, with a watermark. Adds opt-in Ignite UI\n      theming (ApexMapsConfiguration.IgniteUI, ThemeOptions.DesignSystem and Tokens); it is off\n      unless you turn it on. Behaviour changes from the core: --apx-series-N and --apx-font-family\n      tokens on the page now apply to maps, and colours in any CSS syntax (names, hsl(), oklch(),\n      var()) now paint in scales and fills instead of every feature taking the first stop.\n\n      0.3.0 Initial release. Wraps apexmaps 0.3.0: choropleth, bubble, marker, arc and line series;\n      13 projections with spec objects; the built-in geometry registry (26 packs, fetched on demand);\n      scales, palettes, pattern and image fills; legend, tooltip, data labels and editorial annotations;\n      zoom, pan, globe rotation, box selection, linked selection and drilldown; the camera API\n      (flyTo/easeTo/jumpTo/fitBounds/frameFeature/resetView); PNG and SVG export; all 17 core events.",
